// Detect Thoughts: `BuffKind::Detecting` applied to `SenseKind::Thought`,
// which reveals sapient minds (`CreatureKind::Humanoid`, the creature
// classification, not the `Body::Humanoid` skeleton -- see the predicate's
// own doc comment in `server/src/sys/detection.rs`). Simplified from the
// D&D original in two ways: it reveals every sapient mind in range rather
// than letting the caster concentrate on one chosen creature, and it never
// surfaces any actual thought content -- there is no dialogue/thought-string
// system to hook into, only the reveal glow and a `SenseKind::Thought` tag.
// Same presence-only shape as every other spell in this family.
//
// No `aoe` in the sheet; using the same 30 ft / 9 m radius the sibling
// level-1 detect spells (`detect_poison_and_disease`) derive theirs from,
// absent any other stated distance for this spell.
//
// `SenseMode::Snapshot`: membership is frozen at cast and held for the
// buff's `Concentration(60)` duration.
SelfBuff(
    buildup_duration: 0.5,
    cast_duration: 0.5,
    recover_duration: 0.3,
    buffs: [
        BuffDesc(
            kind: Detecting,
            data: BuffData(
                strength: 0.0,
                duration: Some(60.0),
                misc_data: Some(Sense(Thought, 9.0, Snapshot)),
            ),
        ),
    ],
    energy_cost: 20,
    enforced_limit: false,
    meta: (
        school: Some(Divination),
        source: Some(Arcane),
        // level 2 spell -> min_level 12, same `level * 6` convention
        // see_invisibility.ron/true_seeing.ron derive from every other
        // shipped spell that sets this field.
        requirements: (min_level: Some(12)),
    ),
)
